{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:96aa6d83d90a544fb906b3a8b185d841e1d6497e4ecbc0017a4c6cb0cf4b63da",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cf1d7b4f03395ab98b4fdd6a5e2f1426452c1af7bb0afac4857e06f06f21ad4",
      "text": "早上好，●●●●プロデューサー。\n你看这本杂志。就是我们之前拍摄的那期。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c22e7b58f0b719702e5e598ecbd52e9a065be06b09ba711a94fa7f6700adde4",
      "text": "我听说正好今天发售，\n刚才顺路去了趟书店买回来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fd4a68318004cda232cd0e5c121d494428c83e556ef0dbc6dadf5bcb2456a49",
      "text": "封面拍得真棒呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dffb68b01158d5b4c0300f05a9b18a1702ce1859b4772db191263557fd7724a8",
      "text": "秀先生的干劲充分传达出来了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fc4d1e60ca6d0fcc2bd77ae413045f1b38b4d81bbce93a46ca9ad3a3f366a88",
      "text": "那当然啦。我可是拿出了比平时更足的干劲去对待的……\n正如你所预期的那样，展现出了超棒的工作水准对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad351a8cd44bd3fff1162c08043aeef085334521aadef9b0689187221c72b88e",
      "text": "我说制作人。\n这本送你啦。我现在给你签上名。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5d150226a7b6b9aecf6834f720f0407c92816ed9e7e2ac221672d15ca2d749f",
      "text": "寄托了你的期待在负责制作的、\n天峰秀这位最顶尖偶像的最顶尖工作成果……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0ad3d9f6cb7119d746afc1118c8e971fe992a5f0951645e4d549af532ce00f1",
      "text": "把那个附带亲笔签名作为礼物送你。对你而言，\n没有比这更开心的来自偶像的回礼了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:218c176a8f6df6a85b87e222de9c51b945eb9137cc3482dbe0ac4f370cafa6e0",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n今后我也对你满怀期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0505da6cc322b669528e85c18b227acc223efb3705b9484bd1146228bf5ad411",
      "text": "你想期待多少尽管期待就好啦。\n因为我会展现出超乎其上的亮眼表现给你看的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_23_5_02_047_23:5_02_047_23:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2e800f0c22e1e95356e9949a4031cac7c633f2b89936c08803f65cd8bf293f3",
      "text": "这本杂志可要收好哦。带我签名的东西，\n从今往后可是会越来越身价倍增的绝品啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
